# Integrations — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@integration = ai_broker
# {integration} is the registry key (ai_broker, telegram_business, viber, ...), not a numeric id; unknown key -> 404.
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Integrations operations: /api/docs (tag "Integrations").

### GET /api/integrations — integrations.index
GET {{host}}/api/integrations
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/integrations/itstep-directory/status — preparation state (superadmin)
GET {{host}}/api/integrations/itstep-directory/status
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/integrations/itstep-directory/synthetic-preview — fake-only preview (superadmin)
GET {{host}}/api/integrations/itstep-directory/synthetic-preview
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

# Live preview currently returns 409 dependency_pending: the SDK and source contract are not installed/confirmed.

### GET /api/integrations/itstep-directory/preview — read-only preview from the gateway (superadmin); 409 dependency_pending until the SDK is installed
GET {{host}}/api/integrations/itstep-directory/preview
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### PUT /api/integrations/ai-policy — integrations.ai-policy
PUT {{host}}/api/integrations/ai-policy
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "enabled": true
}

### PUT /api/integrations/{integration} — integrations.update
PUT {{host}}/api/integrations/{{integration}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "settings": {
        "base_url": "https://example.com"
    },
    "secrets": {
        "project_key": "<PROJECT_KEY>"
    }
}

### GET /api/integrations/{integration}/logs — integrations.logs
GET {{host}}/api/integrations/{{integration}}/logs
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/integrations/{integration}/check — integrations.check
POST {{host}}/api/integrations/{{integration}}/check
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/

### POST /api/integrations/{integration}/status — integrations.status
POST {{host}}/api/integrations/{{integration}}/status
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "off"
}
